# Allowlist: the image context contains only what goho-server needs to run.
# Anything not listed here, including env files and local data, never reaches the image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages/core/
!packages/goho-api/
!programs/goho-server/

**/node_modules
**/.turbo
**/.data
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/test
**/coverage
